# XCU rmdel
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
#
# SCCS files are made and inspected only with the SCCS utilities (admin,
# get, delta, prs and friends); the file format is unspecified so nothing
# reads the files directly. A missing companion utility makes the test
# UNRESOLVED. Login names, dates and the diagnostic texts are never compared
# literally.

assertion  XCU.rmdel.001
anchor     utilities/rmdel.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     utilities/rmdel.html#OPTIONS
class      conditional
when       XSI
since      1992
says       rmdel -r SID removes the newest delta of a branch silently and
           what get retrieves goes back to the earlier version.
test       t/001-remove-latest.sh

assertion  XCU.rmdel.002
anchor     utilities/rmdel.html#DESCRIPTION
class      conditional
when       XSI
since      1992
says       rmdel of a delta that is not the latest, if refused with a
           non-zero status, leaves the file unchanged (success is
           UNRESOLVED: the page states the rule but not the consequence).
test       t/002-only-latest.sh

assertion  XCU.rmdel.003
anchor     utilities/rmdel.html#DESCRIPTION
class      conditional
when       XSI
since      1992
says       rmdel of a SID that is listed in the p-file, if refused with a
           non-zero status, leaves the file unchanged (success is
           UNRESOLVED: the application is to ensure the SID is not listed).
test       t/003-pending-edit.sh

assertion  XCU.rmdel.004
anchor     utilities/rmdel.html#EXIT STATUS
class      conditional
when       XSI
since      1992
says       A nonexistent file or a nonexistent SID gives a non-zero status.
test       t/004-errors.sh

assertion  XCU.rmdel.005
anchor     utilities/rmdel.html#OPERANDS
anchor     utilities/rmdel.html#STDIN
class      conditional
when       XSI
since      1992
says       A single - operand reads SCCS file names from standard input.
test       t/005-stdin-names.sh
